@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
actor Resident
participant MonitorPanel
participant MonitorController
participant ReadingService
participant OpenMeteoClient
participant ReadingCache
participant AlertMonitor
Resident -> MonitorPanel: Choose district and refresh
MonitorPanel -> MonitorController: refresh(district)
MonitorController -> MonitorPanel: loading(true) on EDT
MonitorController ->> ReadingService: worker refresh(district)
ReadingService -> OpenMeteoClient: fetch(district)
alt 2xx and validated current model hour
OpenMeteoClient --> ReadingService: Reading
ReadingService -> ReadingCache: save(Reading)
ReadingService -> AlertMonitor: publish(Reading)
else transport, response or validation failure
OpenMeteoClient --> ReadingService: ApiFailure
ReadingService -> ReadingCache: load(district)
ReadingCache --> ReadingService: verified cache or empty
end
ReadingService --> MonitorController: LIVE / CACHED / UNAVAILABLE
MonitorController ->> MonitorPanel: loading(false) + reading on EDT
@enduml
